sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports setting cost limits
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Test System has TxCtrlr.SupportedLimits containing maxCost
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Test System has TariffCostCtrlr.Enabled[Cost] is false
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPreSession

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Started, triggerReason = ChargingStateChanged, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>, evse.id = <Configured evseId>, evse.connectorId = <Configured connectorId>, transactionInfo.transactionId = <transactionId>, transactionInfo.chargingState = Charging)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: totalCost must be <not omitted><br>transactionInfo.transactionLimit.maxEnergy must be <omitted><br>transactionInfo.transactionLimit.maxTime must be <omitted><br>transactionInfo.transactionLimit.maxCost must be 10

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = LimitSet, transactionInfo.transactionLimit.maxCost = 10)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: totalCost must be <not omitted><br>transactionInfo.transactionLimit must be <omitted>

    opt CSMS sends a CostUpdatedRequest (not required, but if sent the validation applies)
        CSMS->>CS: CostUpdatedRequest
        Note over CSMS: Validation: transactionId must be <transactionId><br>totalCost must be <not omitted>
        CS-->>CSMS: CostUpdatedResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
